        {
          "content": "Based on the courier delivery log for route 9: the deadline for every parcel was 17:00. All twelve parcels have recorded delivery times ranging from 09:12 (P-01) to 16:44 (P-12). The latest delivery was P-12 at 16:44, which is before the 17:00 deadline. Therefore, the claim that all twelve route 9 parcels were delivered before the deadline is supported by the evidence.",
